  "content": "\n\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"line-height:40.6px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1598915/description_eb076acb-5bb9-49d0-b8fc-ec5decefe5c9.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"144\"></h1>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1598915/description_cdbb9e27-b5df-48a3-a063-c5a8af9a2286.png\" width=\"685\" height=\"79\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>描述</h1>\n<p>OceanX [BEYOND DEEP] 是一個致力於讓 Minecraft 水域充滿生機的整合包。新增多種水域結構、魚類、水下怪物、水下生態系與植物、新物品、可航行的船隻、更優的視覺效果等！如果你正在尋找精彩的水下探索體驗，這個整合包絕對適合你！</p>\n<p>另外，如果你能留言分享遊玩本整合包的心得以及遇到的任何問題，我將不勝感激。</p>\n<h1>常見問題</h1>\n<p>-</p>\n<p>-</p>\n<p>-</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">預覽</h1>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1598915/description_abe0462d-ad75-48a9-99fd-a0bad4fd3882.png\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1598915/description_81f3096d-f155-4d10-8910-2df2eae30609.png\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1598915/description_912400cf-a204-4eed-be8d-428585e2748b.png\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1598915/description_3b708329-c331-418d-b49a-99c6814b8904.png\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1598915/description_58b1250c-50a5-43f1-8f34-2d7f4ee24a2f.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">由 Piotny 製作</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
